<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>힘의 연구소 탈출 — 조별 방탈출</title>
<!--
  조별 방탈출 게임 (2026-11-23, 단서 찾기·자물쇠 판) · 파일 escape.html · 주소 /escape
  · 22차시 뒤 · 수행평가2 앞 빈 1차시용 복습 게임. 성적 미반영
  · 서버 없음. 진행 상황은 이 노트북 브라우저(localStorage)에만 저장
  · 방 그림의 물건을 눌러 단서·아이템을 찾고, 단서의 답으로 자물쇠 비밀번호를 맞춘다
  · 정답은 넣지 않는다 — 비밀번호는 해시값만. 원본: 수업자료/방탈출 게임/원본/rooms.js → build2.js
  · 점수: 방마다 100점, 자물쇠 틀릴 때마다 −20, 힌트 −30, 한 방 최저 40점. 탈출하면 남은 1분마다 +5
-->
<style>
  :root{--ink:#2c3151;--line:#c9cfe6;--red:#e02020;--navy-d:#3f4e9e;--teal-d:#1fa8a0;--violet-d:#7a5ae0;--coral-d:#e8635f;--gold-d:#cf9520;--paper:#f8f9fe;--night:#1e2340;--ok:#18a058;--glow:#ffd76a;}
  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  [hidden]{display:none !important;}
  body{margin:0;background:#141831;font-family:"Apple SD Gothic Neo","Malgun Gothic","맑은 고딕",system-ui,sans-serif;color:var(--ink);min-height:100vh;}
  button{font:inherit;cursor:pointer;}

  /* 입장 */
  #gate{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:60;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:20px;background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 30%,#2f3870,#141831 70%);}
  .card{background:#fff;border-radius:20px;padding:26px;width:440px;max-width:100%;text-align:center;box-shadow:0 18px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.35);}
  .logo{font-size:46px;line-height:1;margin-bottom:6px;}
  h1{font-size:24px;font-weight:900;margin:0 0 4px;}
  .sub{font-size:13px;color:#767ea0;font-weight:700;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:16px;}
  .gRow{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-bottom:10px;}
  .gRow select{flex:1;border:2px solid #dde2f0;border-radius:10px;padding:10px;font:inherit;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;text-align:center;background:#fff;color:var(--ink);}
  .rules{text-align:left;background:var(--paper);border-radius:12px;padding:10px 14px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.75;margin:4px 0 14px;}
  .rules b{color:var(--navy-d);}
  .big{width:100%;border:0;border-radius:12px;padding:13px;font-size:17px;font-weight:900;color:#fff;background:var(--navy-d);}
  .big:hover{filter:brightness(1.1);}
  .big.gold{background:var(--gold-d);}
  .link{background:none;border:0;color:#9aa1c0;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;margin-top:10px;text-decoration:underline;}
  #resetBox{margin-top:8px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#767ea0;}
  #resetBox input{border:2px solid #dde2f0;border-radius:8px;padding:6px;width:120px;text-align:center;font:inherit;}
  #resetBox button{border:0;border-radius:8px;padding:7px 10px;background:var(--coral-d);color:#fff;font-weight:800;}
  .note{font-size:12.5px;color:#767ea0;font-weight:700;margin-top:12px;line-height:1.6;}

  /* 위 막대 */
  #bar{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:10;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:9px 16px;background:#0d1026;color:#fff;}
  #bar .who{font-weight:900;font-size:16px;}
  #bar .sp{flex:1;}
  .pill{background:rgba(255,255,255,.1);border-radius:999px;padding:6px 14px;font-weight:900;font-size:15px;color:#fff;}
  #timer.warn{background:var(--coral-d);}
  #scoreNow{color:var(--glow);}
  #doors{display:flex;gap:6px;}
  .dot{width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:8px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:15px;background:#2b3160;}
  .dot.now{outline:2px solid var(--glow);}
  .dot.done{background:#1d5b45;}

  main{max-width:1060px;margin:0 auto;padding:12px 14px 30px;}
  .roomHead{color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin:4px 2px 10px;}
  .roomHead h2{margin:0;font-size:24px;font-weight:900;}
  .roomHead .tp{font-size:13px;color:#aab1d6;font-weight:700;}
  .roomHead .sp{flex:1;}
  #hintBtn{border:0;border-radius:10px;padding:9px 14px;background:var(--gold-d);color:#fff;font-weight:900;}
  #hintBtn.sure{background:var(--coral-d);}
  #intro{background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);color:#dfe3f7;border-radius:12px;padding:10px 14px;font-weight:700;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:10px;}
  #hintBox{background:#fff7e0;border:2px dashed var(--gold-d);border-radius:12px;padding:10px 14px;margin:0 0 10px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.65;white-space:pre-line;}

  /* 방 그림 */
  #sceneWrap{position:relative;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.4);}
  #scene svg{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;}
  .obj{cursor:pointer;transition:filter .15s;}
  .obj:hover{filter:drop-shadow(0 0 6px #ffd76a) drop-shadow(0 0 2px #ffd76a);}
  .obj.seen{opacity:.92;}
  #tip{position:absolute;pointer-events:none;background:rgba(13,16,38,.9);color:#fff;font-weight:800;font-size:13px;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:8px;transform:translate(-50%,-140%);white-space:nowrap;}

  /* 소지품 */
  #inv{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 2fr;gap:10px;margin-top:10px;}
  .invRow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:#0d1026;border-radius:14px;padding:8px 12px;color:#aab1d6;font-weight:800;font-size:13px;min-height:54px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .invLbl{color:#fff;font-weight:900;margin-right:4px;}
  .empty{color:#6c7398;font-size:12.5px;}
  .slot.item{background:#5b3f12;border:2px solid var(--gold-d);}
  .slot{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;background:#2b3160;color:#fff;border-radius:10px;padding:6px 11px;font-weight:800;font-size:14px;border:0;}
  .slot .sy{display:inline-block;width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--glow);color:var(--night);text-align:center;line-height:24px;font-size:13px;}
  button.slot:hover{background:#3a4278;}

  /* 팝업 */
  #modal{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:40;background:rgba(5,7,20,.7);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:16px;}
  #mBox{background:#fffdf6;border-radius:18px;padding:20px 22px;width:600px;max-width:100%;max-height:92vh;overflow:auto;box-shadow:0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.5);position:relative;}
  #mBox.paper{background:#fff8e6;background-image:repeating-linear-gradient(#fff8e6 0 31px,#efe3c2 31px 32px);}
  #mClose{position:absolute;right:12px;top:10px;border:0;background:none;font-size:24px;color:#9aa1c0;}
  .mt{font-size:19px;font-weight:900;margin:0 30px 10px 0;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;}
  .mt .sy{width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--night);color:var(--glow);display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:18px;flex:none;}
  .mq{font-size:17px;font-weight:800;line-height:1.65;white-space:pre-line;}
  .mo{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:8px 0;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.9;}
  .mtail{margin-top:10px;font-size:18px;font-weight:900;color:var(--navy-d);}
  .mfig{text-align:center;margin:8px 0;}
  .mtext{font-size:17px;font-weight:800;line-height:1.7;}
  .gain{margin-top:12px;background:#e8f7ee;border-radius:12px;padding:10px;font-weight:900;color:var(--ok);font-size:16px;text-align:center;}

  /* 자물쇠 */
  .lockBody{background:linear-gradient(#5b6378,#3a4152);border-radius:18px;padding:18px;margin-top:8px;color:#fff;text-align:center;}
  .dials{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:12px;margin:6px 0 12px;}
  .dial{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:4px;}
  .dial .sy{font-size:20px;color:var(--glow);font-weight:900;}
  .dial button{min-width:58px;width:100%;border:0;border-radius:8px;background:#232838;color:#cfd5ea;font-size:16px;padding:3px 0;}
  .dial .v.wide{width:150px;font-size:24px;}
  .dial .v{width:58px;height:66px;border-radius:10px;background:#fdfdfd;color:var(--ink);font-size:40px;font-weight:900;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;box-shadow:inset 0 3px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.25);user-select:none;}
  .lockMsg{min-height:22px;font-weight:900;margin-top:8px;}
  .lockMsg.bad{color:#ffb3ad;}
  .shake{animation:sh .35s;}
  @keyframes sh{20%,60%{transform:translateX(-8px)}40%,80%{transform:translateX(8px)}}

  /* 방 탈출 */
  #clear{margin-top:12px;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;padding:16px;text-align:center;}
  #clear .t{font-size:22px;font-weight:900;color:var(--ok);margin-bottom:4px;}
  #clear .s{font-size:15px;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:12px;}

  /* 결과 */
  #result{max-width:560px;margin:30px auto;padding:0 16px;}
  #result .card{width:auto;}
  #rTitle{font-size:26px;font-weight:900;margin:4px 0;}
  #rWho{font-size:18px;font-weight:900;color:var(--navy-d);}
  #rTotal{font-size:72px;font-weight:900;color:var(--gold-d);line-height:1.1;margin:8px 0 2px;}
  table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:12px;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;}
  td,th{border-bottom:1px solid #e3e7f3;padding:7px 6px;text-align:left;}
  th{color:#767ea0;font-size:12px;}
  td.r,th.r{text-align:right;}
  tr.sum td{font-weight:900;border-top:2px solid var(--ink);}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div id="gate">
  <div class="card">
    <div class="logo">🔬🔒</div>
    <h1>힘의 연구소 탈출</h1>
    <div class="sub">연구소 문이 모두 잠겼다! 방 안을 뒤져 단서를 찾고, 자물쇠를 열어 탈출하라.</div>
    <div class="gRow">
      <select id="selCls"><option value="">반</option><option>1</option><option>2</option><option>3</option><option>4</option></select>
      <select id="selTeam"><option value="">조</option><option>1</option><option>2</option><option>3</option><option>4</option><option>5</option><option>6</option><option>7</option><option>8</option></select>
    </div>
    <div class="rules">
      🔍 방 그림의 <b>물건을 눌러</b> 단서와 아이템을 찾아요 (꽝도 있어요)<br>
      🔒 단서의 답으로 <b>자물쇠 비밀번호</b>를 맞추면 다음 방<br>
      ⭐ 방마다 <b>100점</b> · 자물쇠 틀리면 <b>−20</b> · 힌트 <b>−30</b> (최저 40점)<br>
      ⏱ 제한 <b>30분</b> · 일찍 탈출하면 남은 1분마다 <b>+5</b>
    </div>
    <button class="big" id="goBtn">입장하기</button>
    <div id="resumeNote" class="note" hidden></div>
    <button class="link" id="resetLink" hidden>처음부터 다시 하기 (선생님 확인)</button>
    <div id="resetBox" hidden>‘처음부터’라고 입력 <input id="resetTxt"> <button id="resetGo">지우기</button></div>
  </div>
</div>

<div id="bar" hidden>
  <span class="who" id="who"></span><span id="doors"></span>
  <span class="sp"></span>
  <span class="pill">점수 <span id="scoreNow">0</span></span>
  <span class="pill" id="timer">30:00</span>
</div>

<main id="room" hidden>
  <div class="roomHead"><div><h2 id="rName"></h2><div class="tp" id="rTopic"></div></div><span class="sp"></span><button id="hintBtn">💡 힌트 (−30)</button></div>
  <div id="intro"></div>
  <div id="hintBox" hidden></div>
  <div id="sceneWrap"><div id="scene"></div><div id="tip" hidden></div></div>
  <div id="inv"><div class="invRow"><span class="invLbl">🎒 소지품</span><span id="invItems"></span></div><div class="invRow"><span class="invLbl">📜 단서</span><span id="invClues"></span></div></div>
  <div id="clear" hidden></div>
</main>

<div id="modal" hidden><div id="mBox"><button id="mClose">✕</button><div id="mBody"></div></div></div>
<div id="result" hidden></div>

